Package: sedir-archive-keyring
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: The SedirOS Authors <ahmetatakan.tech@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: apt (>= 2.4)
Description: SedirOS apt repository: signing key and source
 Lets apt install updates of SedirOS's own packages (sedir-*):
  - the repository's OpenPGP signing key
  - /etc/apt/sources.list.d/sedir.sources, bound to that key only
    (Signed-By), so the key cannot sign any other repository and other
    keys cannot sign this one
  - an apt pin that only accepts sedir-* packages from the repository:
    even a compromised repository or key cannot replace Debian packages
    such as openssh-server
